          "caption": "The statue of Sir Bobby Robson outside Newcastle United F.C.'s home stadium St James' Park in Newcastle upon Tyne, England. It stands outside the south west corner of the ground, facing outwards. Robson was manager of the club from 1999 until 2004, his last managerial appointment. Sculpted by Tom Maley, it was unveiled on 6 May 2012 nearly three years after his death in on 31 July 2009. See the category for full details.",
